# The fighting skills' refusals and misses, with only area_update running, so a fight is the round a command starts.
# In the temple square (3005), away from Hassan: Smokegod (60), Cherub (52, a mage, who can't use the warriors' and
# thieves' skills), and a group led by Heroic (51, a warrior with every skill at 100) with
# Locksmith (30, a thief, every skill at 100) and Decimus (10, a warrior, rescue at 1%).
# - bash, trip, kick and disarm not known
# - bash a resting duck (it has to get up), trip it (ducks fly), bash yourself, trip a flying dragon;
#   backstab with no weapon; rescue a mob; disarm an unarmed foe
# - Locksmith fights a duck that Decimus fails to rescue them from; Seer (20, outside the group) can't bash a drunk
#   fighting Decimus (kill stealing)
# - Heroic fights a pet dragon (350) with a sword that won't come off, then a drunk with one that can't be dropped
#   (the drunk keeps it), and kicks dirt in the drunk's eyes, and again once it's blind
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
goto 3005
@connect cher
Cherub
smoke123
@return
@return
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@connect lock
Locksmith
psswrd
@return
@return
@connect seer
Seer
psswrd
@return
@return
@connect hero
Heroic
psswrd
@return
@return
@as god
set skill heroic all 100
set skill locksmith all 100
transfer cherub 3005
transfer decimus 3005
transfer locksmith 3005
transfer heroic 3005
transfer seer 3005
@as lock
follow heroic
@as dec
follow heroic
@as hero
group locksmith
group decimus
@as cher
bash
trip
kick
disarm
@pulse 30
@as god
@mob 3124 3005
force duck rest
@as hero
bash duck
trip duck
bash heroic
@as god
force duck stand
@mob 350 3005
@as hero
trip dragon
@as lock
remove sword
@pulse 4
backstab duck
rescue duck
@as hero
kill duck
@pulse 12
disarm
@as god
peace
@as lock
wield sword
@pulse 4
@as god
@mob 3124 3005
force duck kill locksmith
@as dec
rescue locksmith
@pulse 12
@as god
peace
@mob 3064 3005
force drunk kill decimus
@as seer
bash drunk
@as god
peace
slay dragon
@mob 350 3005
@obj 3021 3005
set obj sword extra 4096
force dragon get sword
force dragon wield sword
@as hero
kill dragon
@pulse 24
disarm
@pulse 24
@as god
peace
slay dragon
@mob 3064 3005
@obj 3021 3005
set obj sword extra 128
force drunk get sword
force drunk wield sword
@as hero
kill drunk
@pulse 24
disarm
@pulse 24
dirt
@pulse 24
dirt
@pulse 24
@state
